WEBVTT

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:17.330
It's YOU who will die here!

00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:19.170
Hero binding spell:

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:21.040
Anti-Leo!

00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:33.830
No! He's going to dodge it!

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:35.710
I've failed us all!

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:39.880
I've protected no one, accomplished nothing...

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.330
This is where I meet my end!

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:53.000
(Thank you.)

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:58.460
Live, live on, with all your might

00:00:58.460 --> 00:01:02.960
Follow the light to the future

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:16.830
Betrayed and left behind in this lonely world

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:22.380
Fearing a tomorrow I've lost sight of

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:25.500
Ibasho o sagasu
I search for the place I belong

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:32.000
My heart screams out, "I want to be needed"

00:01:33.210 --> 00:01:40.750
I want to puzzle out these entwined identities, but can I trust them?

00:01:40.750 --> 00:01:44.170
Live, live on, with all your might

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:48.170
Follow the light to the future

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:51.670
Even if you lose everything

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:56.000
Stay connected to hope

00:01:56.210 --> 00:01:59.710
I don't know why I'm here

00:02:00.130 --> 00:02:03.580
But that's all right with me right now

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:07.460
I have to overcome and press on

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:13.380
So I can smile with you again

00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:31.170
<b>What Makes a Hero</b>

00:02:35.290 --> 00:02:38.040
Protect humanity from evil.

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:40.880
Protect humanity from evil.

00:02:41.130 --> 00:02:43.710
Protect humanity from evil.

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:46.630
Protect humanity from evil.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:49.670
Protect humanity from evil...

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:49.670
Save the world.

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:54.710
I was to obey that order from the moment I was born.

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:07.080
It was fine at first.

00:03:07.460 --> 00:03:11.130
Just as Master Eibrad had said,

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:14.130
the current world fulfilled my purpose.

00:03:14.830 --> 00:03:17.420
The people wanted what I had to offer.

00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:20.130
I fought alongside allies,

00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:22.290
defeated powerful foes,

00:03:24.130 --> 00:03:26.630
and brought peace to the world.

00:03:26.920 --> 00:03:32.920
I was pure and innocent then, celebrating that peace
from the bottom of my heart.

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:34.790
Yet...

00:03:36.670 --> 00:03:40.000
The peace stretched on and on,

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:43.960
and the world found itself without need for a hero...

00:03:44.920 --> 00:03:47.960
I no longer had a reason to exist.

00:04:10.210 --> 00:04:12.710
So there IS more for me to fight!

00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:15.290
Regional conflicts...

00:04:16.080 --> 00:04:20.540
Guess humans and demons couldn't
coexist peacefully after all.

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:23.290
Wars between nations...

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:28.460
Sheesh, you guys need to learn your lesson already.

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:31.920
Then, an invasion from the Demon World.

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:37.670
I felt the world was telling me
that I only deserved to live in it...

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:40.580
...when I was fighting.

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:44.500
I can fight again. I can be a hero again!

00:04:44.670 --> 00:04:46.250
I can save humanity again!

00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:50.880
A hundred years passed, then two hundred.

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:53.960
Before I knew it, five hundred. A thousand.

00:04:54.380 --> 00:04:56.580
Then more, as time flowed endlessly on.

00:04:57.380 --> 00:05:05.170
I traveled the world, searching for battle,
fighting endlessly on...

00:05:06.460 --> 00:05:11.210
DH-05, Leo, was built around hyper skill development.

00:05:11.460 --> 00:05:15.630
With every enemy I fought,
I would gain new techniques,

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:19.330
and eventually, I stopped encountering even matches.

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:24.580
I had become what the scientists who
made me had wanted me to become:

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:32.710
An unstoppable, unkillable, immortal bioweapon.

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:41.420
Then, once again, a long peace took hold.

00:05:45.540 --> 00:05:47.630
Get your fresh-baked bread!

00:05:48.170 --> 00:05:49.290
Hello, there!

00:05:49.460 --> 00:05:50.670
This, please!

00:05:50.670 --> 00:05:52.580
Goodness, only one?

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:54.130
Yup, it's okay!

00:05:54.460 --> 00:05:55.880
We'll share it!

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:59.540
Is that right? What good kids you are.

00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:01.330
Here.

00:06:01.580 --> 00:06:02.170
Are you sure?!

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:03.040
Yay!

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:04.210
Here you go.

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:05.170
Thank you!

00:06:05.170 --> 00:06:06.380
Come by again soon!

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:10.330
I hope this peaceful world lasts forever.

00:06:11.420 --> 00:06:16.130
Hey, why aren't you smiling? You're supposed to smile.

00:06:16.130 --> 00:06:19.210
Smile and say "Me too".

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:25.710
Eventually, I realized there was a part of me
that wanted the world to be in danger.

00:06:26.130 --> 00:06:32.880
I wanted every person,
every lifeform on this planet, to need me.

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:37.210
To be in the same hopeless peril
it was when I was made.

00:06:37.920 --> 00:06:42.710
I want to save the world. Please, let me save it!

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:44.630
If I can't save the world, I'll lose myself!

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:49.500
Bring more danger to humanity!
Bring more chaos to the world!

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:53.420
Every day, more desire for destruction.

00:06:54.750 --> 00:06:57.330
Every day, more errors in my consciousness.

00:07:03.130 --> 00:07:07.250
I could just do it myself. Plunge the world into peril.

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:12.630
It's so obvious. Why didn't I think of it before?

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:19.710
The DH series had a feature that prevented
the unit from bringing harm to humanity:

00:07:20.630 --> 00:07:24.830
Thought Masking. It prevented
the unit from thinking harmful thoughts.

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:31.790
But developing a sense of self, growing an ego,
had disabled its functionality for me.

00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:38.790
And I knew how to do it. How to craft
the perfect crisis for my world.

00:07:39.710 --> 00:07:45.040
Though I couldn't recreate the Akashic Engine,
I made the Heroes the same as they were,

00:07:45.040 --> 00:07:49.250
three thousand years ago,
when they'd first saved humanity.

00:07:51.380 --> 00:07:54.580
It's been too long, everyone. This is 05-Leo.

00:07:55.420 --> 00:07:59.330
It really has. Look how much I've changed.

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:04.580
You have a mission. Please give me a world to save.

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:07.130
Kill all of humanity,

00:08:07.670 --> 00:08:09.630
so I can protect them.

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:11.710
For I...

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:13.040
'Cause I...

00:08:15.130 --> 00:08:16.540
I still don't want to die.

00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:18.920
I still want to live.

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:22.500
I still want to be a hero!

00:08:36.130 --> 00:08:38.710
Demons! Demons are attacking!

00:08:38.960 --> 00:08:39.790
What?!

00:08:41.130 --> 00:08:42.670
Inform the King at once!

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:45.170
Tell me what's happening.

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:48.000
A huge portal opened up in the Seshat Mountains,

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:49.630
and demons started pouring through!

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:51.830
Don't worry, I'll handle them.

00:08:54.170 --> 00:08:56.790
What was I doing?

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:30.080
Well, damn...

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:35.500
I was going to destroy humanity for
my own selfish satisfaction.

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:39.080
I was no hero. Not anymore.

00:09:39.920 --> 00:09:43.420
Only a demon would do this.

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:46.380
I'm the REAL Demon King here.

00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:49.460
Protect humanity from evil.

00:09:49.460 --> 00:09:53.670
Protect humanity from evil.

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:58.630
That evil is HERE. I'M that evil!

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:04.170
The only surviving unit of the Demonhart Series, 05-Leo,

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:09.460
was the greatest evil threatening the world.

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:09.460
Protect humanity from evil.

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:16.790
I'd destroy the world for my own selfish cause,
toy with human lives to fulfill my own desires.

00:10:17.540 --> 00:10:19.750
No Demon King could be more evil than I was.

00:10:20.170 --> 00:10:22.710
Protect humanity from evil.

00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:28.670
I know, I know. I've got a plan.

00:10:29.880 --> 00:10:33.710
It's not like I haven't learned anything
these last three thousand years!

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:39.250
Soon, I was setting off on a mission
to destroy the Demon Army.

00:10:39.710 --> 00:10:42.920
I was the hero who would save the world.

00:10:43.630 --> 00:10:47.540
I promise, I will defeat the Demon Queen and her army.

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:54.670
I had to quit heroing.

00:10:55.710 --> 00:10:59.170
I had to defeat evil.

00:10:59.830 --> 00:11:02.790
But I couldn't just be defeated.

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:07.500
I needed to leave the Akashic Engine, the
Philosopher's Stone, to someone worthy.

00:11:08.540 --> 00:11:14.130
They had to be strong enough to defeat me,
to defend humanity in my stead.

00:11:16.790 --> 00:11:17.960
What are you doing?!

00:11:19.830 --> 00:11:21.420
You heard my orders!

00:11:21.420 --> 00:11:24.330
Yes, this is an invasion,
but we must avoid killing whenever possible!

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:27.630
Any territory we occupy must be ruled peacefully!

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:29.420
Is that understood?!

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:34.920
Your Queen commands you!
No pillaging, no destruction, no arson!

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:38.380
And do NOT slaughter innocent civilians!

00:11:39.040 --> 00:11:42.250
Remember, we did not come here to wage war!

00:11:43.630 --> 00:11:46.460
Is an invasion not war?

00:11:47.210 --> 00:11:51.670
Yet that was the kind of Queen she was.

00:11:53.790 --> 00:11:56.750
Fine, I'll talk, I'll talk!

00:11:57.080 --> 00:12:00.630
Queen Echidna's just... kinda weird!

00:12:00.630 --> 00:12:05.750
She invaded the human world 'cause she wants to make
the Demon World a better place.

00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:08.460
There's never been a Demon King like her!

00:12:08.960 --> 00:12:11.750
I've never met a woman as deserving of praise as her.

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:16.000
She forbids us from doing unjust harm
to humans in the course of our invasion,

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:21.380
and she even stands on the front lines
to lead us into battle!

00:12:21.790 --> 00:12:26.710
She hands out praise to everyone,
even us low-level imps!

00:12:26.710 --> 00:12:29.540
Queen Echidna's a kind ruler!

00:12:42.960 --> 00:12:45.210
Never would've guessed it'd be the Demon Queen.

00:12:46.130 --> 00:12:53.380
But this Echidna could have been
the successor I'd been looking for.

00:12:54.380 --> 00:12:58.000
Hell, she might be able to do more
than just take my heart.

00:12:58.460 --> 00:13:04.040
She could become the bridge between the human and
demon realms.

00:13:04.540 --> 00:13:06.460
I should give her an interview.

00:13:07.420 --> 00:13:10.750
But first, I should save the world.

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:16.000
That was the day I began my final journey.

00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:18.830
I vow with all my honor as a warrior: you shall not pass!

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:22.330
Then I vow with all my honor as a hero that I will!

00:13:25.790 --> 00:13:29.210
It was a journey to stop heroing.

00:13:29.710 --> 00:13:31.540
I will kill you.

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:33.960
Sure! Do it, if you can!

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:37.540
A journey to kill the Hero Leo.

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:41.170
Don't hurt Echidna!

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:45.250
Do you have a screw loose?! You've got
to be stupid to be asking me that right now!

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:49.580
I'd find out what Echidna and
her Four Generals were all about.

00:13:49.880 --> 00:13:54.250
I will see Queen Echidna's dreams realized. I will see
peace come to the Demon World!

00:13:54.460 --> 00:13:56.290
And I will happily die for her cause!

00:13:56.420 --> 00:14:00.420
Damn, you practically sound like the hero, here!

00:14:01.670 --> 00:14:04.210
I'd see if they were trustworthy.

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:18.080
So YOU are the Hero Leo.

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:22.380
Queen Echidna, I'm here to see what you've got for me!

00:14:28.670 --> 00:14:32.420
I'd work for her, learn her thoughts and feelings,

00:14:33.170 --> 00:14:37.500
and determine if she was the right person
to whom to entrust my heart.

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:41.500
And then, I would die.

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:47.920
The Demon King must be defeated.
That's just how the world works.

00:14:49.630 --> 00:14:54.330
After three thousands years of life,
the bug-riddled bioweapon...

00:14:53.880 --> 00:14:55.460
It's YOU who will die here!

00:14:55.460 --> 00:14:58.540
...chose this absurd theatrical display

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:01.130
as his method of suicide.

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:05.920
Hero binding spell:

00:15:06.330 --> 00:15:07.500
Anti-Leo!

00:15:17.040 --> 00:15:17.960
No...

00:15:19.420 --> 00:15:20.630
Thank you.

00:15:23.210 --> 00:15:28.830
That smile... Was this what Leo wanted all along?

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:46.920
Every bone in my body is straining against it.

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:49.500
It's ravaging me from the inside out!

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:57.040
Unsurprising. I'm binding three
thousand years of power all by myself.

00:15:57.540 --> 00:15:58.960
This is my only chance!

00:15:59.210 --> 00:16:03.380
I can only keep his power bound for six more seconds...

00:16:04.460 --> 00:16:07.170
It's been a long while since
I've been in this much danger.

00:16:08.080 --> 00:16:10.040
My body feels heavy.

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:12.580
I can't even lift a finger.

00:16:13.290 --> 00:16:19.580
The regeneration I'd learned from Virgo,
the auto-counter I'd learned from Aquarius,

00:16:20.290 --> 00:16:24.920
the self-enhancements from Taurus and Cancer,
the speed from Gemini...

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:30.540
Every last special ability of mine, blocked from use.

00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:36.170
I'm the same weak 05-Leo I was at the start.

00:16:36.880 --> 00:16:42.290
Time feels like it's moving in slow motion.
Like my life's gonna flash before my eyes.

00:16:43.750 --> 00:16:46.790
I'm finally going to die.

00:16:52.500 --> 00:16:54.290
She's in a lot of pain...

00:16:55.170 --> 00:17:00.920
But I can see in her eyes that she knows
she'll succeed, that her comrades will succeed.

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:05.420
What are you trying to say to me with those eyes?!

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:08.670
I had a premonition.

00:17:08.880 --> 00:17:14.170
Queen Echidna, the Hero Leo is quickly fighting his
way through our soldiers!

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:20.250
When I heard that name, and realized it
was in the name of the spell, I had a feeling.

00:17:20.790 --> 00:17:25.290
But the King who had devised the spell,
Astarot, did so hundreds of years ago.

00:17:25.290 --> 00:17:29.420
No human he fought back then could
be alive today, or so I thought.

00:17:29.790 --> 00:17:33.460
But when Leo told me he was
born during the Mechanical Age,

00:17:34.250 --> 00:17:38.420
that premonition became all but absolute.

00:17:38.420 --> 00:17:42.210
This hero has lived for three thousand years.

00:17:42.920 --> 00:17:48.330
The hero who fought Astarot was the same hero
that fought every other Demon King.

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:52.330
The names they called him may have been different,
but it was only him.

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:57.080
He had no friends, no place to return to, no place to die.

00:17:57.380 --> 00:18:02.580
He would continue to live a lonely existence,
protecting humanity all on his lonesome.

00:18:03.040 --> 00:18:05.460
That is the fate of the Hero Leo.

00:18:06.580 --> 00:18:08.290
What's that look for?

00:18:08.630 --> 00:18:11.460
You're fine. You've got this.

00:18:12.330 --> 00:18:15.170
No one can do everything alone.

00:18:15.630 --> 00:18:19.080
That's why being able to trust others...

00:18:19.830 --> 00:18:24.080
is the one trait trait you need,
the most important thing to have as a hero.

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:32.580
I couldn't do that. I failed as a hero.
I could never trust anyone.

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:36.920
How did it feel to fight through those eons?

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:39.330
Why didn't he show weakness to anyone?

00:18:39.330 --> 00:18:41.790
Why didn't he open his heart to anyone?

00:18:42.130 --> 00:18:45.460
I thought I had to be the one to protect the world.

00:18:46.040 --> 00:18:50.880
That no one would accept me
if I decided to stop being the hero.

00:18:50.880 --> 00:18:55.830
You're so foolishly obsessed with your mission
that you follow it to your death!

00:18:55.960 --> 00:19:01.330
Do unto others as you would have them do unto you.

00:19:01.670 --> 00:19:03.710
Is that how the saying goes?

00:19:04.210 --> 00:19:08.540
Wow. That's kinda funny.

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:11.500
How could anyone find that funny?!

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:15.210
I acted all high-and-mighty when I gave you advice...

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:17.960
You helped my Generals to the best of your ability...

00:19:18.420 --> 00:19:20.420
But in the end, all I wanted...

00:19:21.580 --> 00:19:24.290
All I ever wanted...

00:19:24.960 --> 00:19:26.580
But you must have wanted someone to save YOU!

00:19:27.920 --> 00:19:30.790
...was for someone to accept me for who I was.

00:19:31.540 --> 00:19:36.790
For someone to say they didn't care
if I wasn't the hero, to come with them.

00:19:36.960 --> 00:19:38.210
For someone to tell me...

00:19:38.500 --> 00:19:40.540
that they'd save me.

00:19:40.880 --> 00:19:45.040
He would let himself get this hurt,
all for the sake of protecting humanity.

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:48.210
But who was protecting the hero?!

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:52.880
When he was suffering in the dark abyss,
who offered him their hand?!

00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:57.170
But it's okay. I'm glad I picked Echidna.

00:19:57.960 --> 00:20:00.750
I'm glad I picked them to be my last companions.

00:20:01.670 --> 00:20:07.500
I know that even if I die, they'll be able to bring
the human and demon worlds together.

00:20:08.330 --> 00:20:09.380
You're such a fool!

00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:12.540
Queen Echidna will not tolerate such foolishness!

00:20:12.710 --> 00:20:15.500
I, WE, will offer you our hand!

00:20:16.210 --> 00:20:18.920
I will put an end to this, here and now!

00:20:27.750 --> 00:20:29.040
They're good people.

00:20:29.670 --> 00:20:33.710
I had fun working with them.

00:20:34.130 --> 00:20:38.210
I wish I could've worked with them longer.

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:44.630
Dammit. I don't want to die.

00:20:45.580 --> 00:20:50.330
Leo, if you wish to die a hero's death,
then I will grant it to you!

00:20:50.670 --> 00:20:53.080
Here and now, I will end your life!

00:20:54.210 --> 00:20:56.500
Great Generals, I leave the rest to you!

00:21:03.250 --> 00:21:04.170
Lord Leo!

00:21:04.460 --> 00:21:05.500
You idiot!

00:21:06.420 --> 00:21:07.670
Leo!

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:10.790
Leo...!

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:20.420
Yeah. Bye, now.

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:24.380
I leave the rest to you.

00:23:36.420 --> 00:23:40.880
<b>Next Time:</b>

00:23:36.420 --> 00:23:40.880
<b>I'm Quitting</b>

00:23:36.420 --> 00:23:40.880
<b>Heroing</b>
